					675
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				599
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδῶν σκιρτήματα ἔλαυνε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					836
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
